  "summary": "The UNOnext BACnet MS/TP version is a multi-gas room monitor. Over BACnet it reports temperature, humidity, PM2.5, PM10, CO2, light, TVOC, formaldehyde, CO, ozone, an external NTC temperature and an IAQ index, and has writable values for MAC address, temperature and CO2 calibration, display units and the panel and IAQ LED switches.",
